The graph R4_23_320.txt, graphs.json, the logs and README.md: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . Please credit Peter J. Chrisbacher and cite this repository.
R4_23_320.txt contains the quartic-residue circulant on 313 vertices (Li-Su-Luo-Wu, unpublished 2011; Lindsay-Cain, arXiv 2015) as an
induced subgraph; that graph is defined by a formula and is rebuilt from scratch by build.py.
graphs.json holds small standard graphs (K3, the three (4,3;8)-graphs, Paley graphs of order 9, 13 and 17).
